<title>USA: Teleport Communications wins Indiana nod.</title>
<headline>Teleport Communications wins Indiana nod.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS, Ind. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teleport Communications Group Inc said Friday it will provide local telephone exchange service to consumers in the Indianapolis area as a result of authorization it received from the Indiana Utility Regulatory Commission.</p>
<p>Teleport, a local exchange services provider, is in 557 major markets nationwide.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
